OL,3,ATwo teenagers, 13 and 14, among 33 UK
OL,4,Anationals missing in Nepal floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FThirty-three people from the UK,
OL,7,Fincluding a 13-year-old girl and
OL,8,F14-year-old boy, are among hundreds
OL,9,Fmissing following a deadly flash flood
OL,10,Fnear the Nepal-Tibet border.
OL,12,FNepali police said 270 bodies had now
OL,13,Fbeen recovered from affected areas.
OL,15,FNepal's National Disaster Risk
OL,16,FReduction and Management Authority said
OL,17,Fthat 826 people are missing, with the
OL,18,FNepal Tourism Board saying 644 tourists
OL,19,Fare out of contact.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
