OL,3,ANew data shows fall in visas, asylum
OL,4,Aclaims and small boat arrivals compared
OL,5,Ato year earlier
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe number of people claiming asylum in
OL,8,Fthe UK in the year to June 2026 fell by
OL,9,F21% compared to a year earlier, new
OL,10,Fdata shows
OL,12,FBut the figure - 86,000 - remains above
OL,13,Ftypical levels seen before 2021
OL,15,FThe number of people arriving on small
OL,16,Fboats was 33,000, down 23% on the
OL,17,Fprevious year
OL,19,FThe five most common nationalities on
OL,20,Fsmall boats were Eritrean, Sudanese,
OL,21,FAfghan, Somali and Iranian
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
