OL,3,ANew data shows fall in visas, asylum
OL,4,Aclaims and small boat arrivals compared
OL,5,Ato year earlier
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome 16,000 asylum seekers were being
OL,8,Fhoused in hotels in June - that's 50%
OL,9,Fdown on a year earlier
OL,11,FThe number of visas granted for work,
OL,12,Fstudy, and families also fell
OL,14,FHome Secretary Shabana Mahmood says the
OL,15,Fgovernment is "not complacent and there
OL,16,Fis more we must do"
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
